.TH "DNSSCAN" "1" "Aug 05, 2026" "" "PowerDNS Authoritative Server"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dnsscan \- List the amount of queries per qtype in a pcap
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBdnsscan\fP \fIINFILE\fP\&...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBdnsscan\fP takes one or more \fIINFILE\fPs in PCAP format and generates a
list of the number of queries per qtype.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
None
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
pcap(3PCAP), tcpdump(8)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
PowerDNS.COM BV
